1131	2	2	Policy object (2)	0	{"id": ["None", "2"], "body": ["None", "<h3 style=\\"text-align: center; \\"><strong>Information Security Policy</strong></h3><p><strong>Purpose:</strong><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; To protect company data and systems from unauthorized access, breaches, and misuse.</p><p><strong>Body:</strong><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Employees must safeguard all confidential and sensitive information, including customer data, intellectual property, and internal communications. Use secure passwords, two-factor authentication, and encryption when handling sensitive data. Access to data should be limited based on job responsibilities. Employees must report any security incidents or suspected breaches immediately to the IT department. Personal use of company systems must not compromise security.</p>"], "title": ["None", "Security Policy"], "is_active": ["None", "True"], "created_at": ["None", "2024-09-21 05:29:43.429000"], "created_by": ["None", "1"], "modified_by": ["None", "1"], "is_visible_to_all": ["None", "True"]}	2026-02-23 12:19:24.034884+05:30	\N	58	127.0.0.1	\N	\N	\N		\N	\N
