1135	4	4	Policy object (4)	0	{"id": ["None", "4"], "body": ["None", "<h3 style=\\"text-align: center; \\"><strong>Data Privacy Policy</strong></h3><p><strong>Purpose:</strong><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;To ensure the company complies with data protection regulations like GDPR and CCPA.</p><p><strong>Body:</strong><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; All personal data collected, processed, or stored by the company must be handled in accordance with applicable data protection laws. Employees should only collect the minimum required data, and consent must be obtained from individuals where necessary. The company is committed to protecting the privacy of its clients and employees, and any data breach must be reported immediately. Employees handling personal data must follow specific protocols for its safe storage, transfer, and deletion.</p>"], "title": ["None", "Data Policy"], "is_active": ["None", "True"], "created_at": ["None", "2024-09-21 05:31:03.855000"], "created_by": ["None", "1"], "modified_by": ["None", "1"], "is_visible_to_all": ["None", "True"]}	2026-02-23 12:19:24.039837+05:30	\N	58	127.0.0.1	\N	\N	\N		\N	\N
