1137	5	5	Policy object (5)	0	{"id": ["None", "5"], "body": ["None", "<h3 style=\\"text-align: center; \\"><strong>Employee Device Usage Policy</strong></h3><p><strong>Purpose:</strong><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; To regulate the use of company-provided and personal devices for work purposes.</p><p><strong>Body:</strong><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Company-provided devices are for professional use only and must be treated responsibly. Employees must ensure that all software on these devices is up-to-date and complies with security standards. Personal devices used for work purposes must also adhere to company security policies, including password protection and approved applications. The IT department may request access to company-provided devices for maintenance or audits.</p>"], "title": ["None", "Device Policy"], "is_active": ["None", "True"], "created_at": ["None", "2024-09-21 05:32:21.877000"], "created_by": ["None", "1"], "modified_by": ["None", "1"], "is_visible_to_all": ["None", "True"]}	2026-02-23 12:19:24.042029+05:30	\N	58	127.0.0.1	\N	\N	\N		\N	\N
